<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Eagle Mining returns to profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Eagle Mining returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		 profit 12.41 vs loss 4.12</p>
<p>    Net			 profit 10.35 vs loss 3.82</p>
<p>    Sales				38.00 vs nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Eagle Mining Ltd is a Western Australia gold producer whose production comes from the Nimary mine acquired last year through the takeover of Matlock Mining NL. Nimary has proven and probably reserves of 839,580 ounces of gold.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
